        "text": "B.  Increased punishment for \r\npossession of larger quantities of \r\ncontrolled drugs deemed to be more \r\ndangerous and harmful\r\n\r\nThe current sentencing framework for drug possession \r\ndoes not sufficiently account for the potential harm that \r\ncould be caused by persons with large amounts of \r\ncontrolled drugs in their possession.\r\n\r\nA more deterrent punishment is necessary to deter \r\nthe proliferation of drugs locally. \r\n\r\n",
